  "short_description": "<p>Handmade spun bamboo bowls from Vietnam – eco-friendly, lightweight, and durable. Perfect for serving or decoration. Wholesale &amp; custom design available.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"472\">Vietnam is well-known for its <strong data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"272\">spun bamboo bowls</strong>, handmade by artisans using traditional coiling techniques. Lightweight, durable, and eco-friendly, these bowls are ideal for <strong data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"434\">serving salad, fruit, or snacks</strong>, as well as stylish <strong data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"469\">home décor</strong>.</p>\n<p data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"466\">Our <strong data-start=\"245\" data-end=\"266\">spun bamboo bowls</strong> are handcrafted in Vietnam using the traditional coiling technique. Each bowl is made from layers of natural bamboo, carefully spun and polished to create a smooth, durable, and lightweight finish.</p>\n<p data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"722\">These bowls are not only functional for <strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"543\">serving salad, fruit, or snacks</strong>, but also bring a natural touch to home décor. Available in <strong data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"647\">natural, lacquered, or painted finishes</strong>, spun bamboo bowls are perfect for both modern and traditional settings.</p>\n<p data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"966\">By choosing our products, you support Vietnamese artisans and contribute to <strong data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"822\">sustainable living</strong>, as bamboo is a fast-growing, eco-friendly material. We also accept <strong data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"914\">OEM &amp; custom orders</strong> with your own designs, colors, and logo branding.</p>\n<p data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1184\"><strong data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1007\">Supplier &amp; Manufacturer in Vietnam:</strong><br data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1010\" />Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd specializes in wholesale bamboo tableware and home décor. We export worldwide with competitive prices, flexible MOQ, and international shipping.</p>\n<p data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1184\">As a trusted <strong data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"549\">bamboo bowl manufacturer and wholesale supplier in Vietnam</strong>, we provide bulk orders, OEM customization, and international shipping.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1255\">📩 For inquiries, please contact us at <strong data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1252\"><a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1250\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a></strong>.</p>",
